[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="PartAssembly" format=3]
; The Precentor (boss placeholder): the choir's conductor, a Votary half again as tall, generated from
; resources/parts/votary.tres scaled by 1.55, with a long cope, a great glyph halo and a straight baton
; in place of the curved blade. Placeholder until the character pass (docs/roadmap.md).
; Joints: X forward, Y up, Z toward the camera (N near side, F far side).

